{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1083.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1ce4e8febb78bb54ba51906e6a14b4c64400cce148227a56f9c7e672d6e2f1d4","ja":"ねえみんな、聞いた！？　この前のグルメバトルを\n見た人から、お仕事のオファーがあったんだって！","zh":"大家听说了吗！？据说有人看了上次的美食对决，\n给我们发来工作邀约了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
