{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1083.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"97f4e55ce4987f730fb6d2d9ed8ada79185ecdefd938c8cf55320880ea54fb46","ja":"風花か～。自分が選ばれなくて残念だけど、\nお仕事頑張ってね、風花！","zh":"是风花啊～。虽然自己没被选上挺遗憾的，\n但工作要加油哦，风花！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
